# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment — never commit real values.
# Real env files must never be committed; the *.local rule above is too incidental to
# rely on. Be explicit, and ship .env.example instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Test output
coverage
# Anchored (2026-10-06): vitest and playwright write `reports/` at the repository root.
# Unanchored, `reports` also matched `src/features/reports/` — the Reports screens' SOURCE —
# so a new file there was silently never committed.
/reports
playwright-report
test-results
.playwright

